{
  "id": "the-simpsons---6x22---round-springfield",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 6x22 - Round Springfield",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 6x22 - Round Springfield.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-19T20:06:10.023Z",
  "lineCount": 286,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Round Springfield",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 5000,
      "endMs": 10000
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Hey, kids, it's story time!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 23624,
      "endMs": 26846
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "I'm gonna tell you the story of Krusty's expensive new suit: His sexual-harassment suit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 27651,
      "endMs": 34832
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Oh, boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 35067,
      "endMs": 36577
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Anyway, as part of Krusty's plea bargain...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 36779,
      "endMs": 38826
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "...he has a new court-ordered sidekick...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 38993,
      "endMs": 40973
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "...Ms. No-Means-No.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 41174,
      "endMs": 43221
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "You're hot. Let's get some dinner after the show.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 45690,
      "endMs": 48483
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "I have dinner with all my employees. Right, Sideshow Mel?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 50138,
      "endMs": 53414
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "We've never spoken outside of work.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 53621,
      "endMs": 55414
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "I'm surprised he didn't blame his problems on his Percodan addiction.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 58897,
      "endMs": 62241
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Wasn't my fault. It was the Percodan.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 62448,
      "endMs": 64517
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "If you ask me, that stuff rots your brain.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 64690,
      "endMs": 67379
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "And now a word from my new sponsor.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 67552,
      "endMs": 69345
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Percodan?! Oh, crap!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 69552,
      "endMs": 72448
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Bart, are you ready for your history test?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 73448,
      "endMs": 75621
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "You bet, Mom. Ask me anything.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 75828,
      "endMs": 77448
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Okay. Who was George Washington Carver?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 77655,
      "endMs": 81897
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "The guy who chopped up George Washington?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 82241,
      "endMs": 84138
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Really?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 84310,
      "endMs": 85793
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Bart, you said you were going to study. My stomach.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 98655,
      "endMs": 102345
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "You just don't wanna take that test. No, I mean it. It really hurts.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 102552,
      "endMs": 106621
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Mom, I think he's serious.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 106828,
      "endMs": 108448
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Kids are so naive.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 108931,
      "endMs": 110345
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Lisa, when you get to be our age, you'll learn a few things.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 110517,
      "endMs": 113517
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Like when a sign says, \"Do not feed the bears\"...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 113724,
      "endMs": 116172
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "...man, you'd better not feed the bears.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 116345,
      "endMs": 118655
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Now, get to school, boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 118828,
      "endMs": 120759
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "Mrs. Krabappel, I can't take the test. I have a stomachache.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 124034,
      "endMs": 127138
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Well, that's a lame excuse for an excuse.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 127276,
      "endMs": 131207
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Look, if you ignore me and I die, you'll get in a lot of trouble.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 131414,
      "endMs": 134724
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Read page six of the school charter.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 134931,
      "endMs": 137414
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "\"No teacher shall be held accountable if Bart Simpson dies.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 137621,
      "endMs": 141552
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "We're also absolved if Milhouse gets eaten by the school snake.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 141759,
      "endMs": 144759
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Hey, cool, there's a rabbit in here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 144931,
      "endMs": 148793
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Mrs. Krabappel, I'm done failing the test. Can I please go to the nurse?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 149931,
      "endMs": 154655
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "Gosh, maybe you really are in pain.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 154862,
      "endMs": 156655
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "Well, it would be cruel not to let you go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 156828,
      "endMs": 160517
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "Now you may go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 170655,
      "endMs": 171655
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "Lunchlady Doris, why are you here?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 173310,
      "endMs": 175931
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Budget cuts. They've even got Groundskeeper Willie teaching French.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 176138,
      "endMs": 180000
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Bonjour, you cheese-eating surrender monkeys.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 180241,
      "endMs": 184448
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Look, my stomach really hurts.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 184655,
      "endMs": 186931
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "All I can give you are these chewable Prozac for kids.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 187138,
      "endMs": 189862
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Your choice: Manic-Depressive Mouse or the Bluebird of Unhappiness.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 190034,
      "endMs": 194586
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Superintendent Chalmers, meet our new school nurse, Lunchlady Doris.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 196138,
      "endMs": 199690
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Nice to see you. Seymour, why is that student lying unconscious on the floor?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 199862,
      "endMs": 203828
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Well, in many cases, the floor is the best...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 204069,
      "endMs": 206414
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Oh, look, here comes Lumpy, the school snake.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 206586,
      "endMs": 208966
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Help! Help!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 209207,
      "endMs": 211241
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Oh, Lord.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 211483,
      "endMs": 213517
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Don't worry, son. You'll be fine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 220586,
      "endMs": 222828
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "This boy's appendix is inflamed and about to burst...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 223000,
      "endMs": 225862
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "...which will make it easier to find once I get in there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 226000,
      "endMs": 229931
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Man, these are primo seats. I could really go for a hot dog.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 231897,
      "endMs": 235621
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "Homer, this is an operation.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 235793,
      "endMs": 237897
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Hot dogs! Get your hot dogs here!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 238069,
      "endMs": 241414
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Okay, Bart, I will count to three, and you will be sound asleep.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 241621,
      "endMs": 246207
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "One, two, three.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 246379,
      "endMs": 249034
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "Out like a light. Scalpel.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 249207,
      "endMs": 251828
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Maybe if I fiddle with these knobs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 254483,
      "endMs": 257448
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Hey, I smell gas.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 258379,
      "endMs": 260241
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "Pleasant gas.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 260414,
      "endMs": 262345
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "Night-night gas.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 262517,
      "endMs": 265310
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "How's my special little guy?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 267966,
      "endMs": 270241
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "How you feeling, big brother?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 270414,
      "endMs": 272862
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "Oh, this is wonderful. You're alive.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 273034,
      "endMs": 275931
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "No thanks to you, Homer. Why, you little...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 276103,
      "endMs": 279138
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Now, Homer, please. The boy's just had a very serious operation.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 282310,
      "endMs": 285862
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "Oh, right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 286034,
      "endMs": 287172
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "Now, Bart, I found the culprit: A jagged, metal cereal O.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 288138,
      "endMs": 292517
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "Wicked. I got this cool scar.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 292724,
      "endMs": 295448
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "And I get to miss a week of school.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 295655,
      "endMs": 297345
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Dr. Hibbert, can I have my appendix out?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 298759,
      "endMs": 301138
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Why not. Follow me, kids.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 305103,
      "endMs": 306966
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "Nurse, prep these children.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 307138,
      "endMs": 309655
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "I'm glad you're okay, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 310897,
      "endMs": 313759
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "Bleeding Gums Murphy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 323621,
      "endMs": 325138
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Little Lisa. It's good to see you again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 325345,
      "endMs": 328586
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "It's been a long time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 328793,
      "endMs": 330793
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "My friends call me Bleeding Gums.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 332724,
      "endMs": 334862
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "How'd you get a name like that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 335069,
      "endMs": 336862
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "Let me put it this way. You ever been to the dentist?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 337069,
      "endMs": 340172
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Yeah. Not me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 340345,
      "endMs": 341414
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "I suppose I should go to one, but I got enough pain in my life as it is.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 341655,
      "endMs": 346621
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "What are you here for? My brother just had his appendix out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 347414,
      "endMs": 350552
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Is he gonna be okay? Hello, I'm Dr. Cheeks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 350759,
      "endMs": 353793
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "I'm doing my rounds, and I'm a little behind.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 353966,
      "endMs": 356517
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "He'll be fine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 356931,
      "endMs": 358759
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "Lisa, I sure am glad you dropped by. You're the first visitor I've had.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 360331,
      "endMs": 365055
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "What about your family? I don't really have a family.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 365262,
      "endMs": 367917
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "All I had was a little brother who grew up to become a doctor.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 368055,
      "endMs": 371297
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "He used to laugh at the most inappropriate times.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 371469,
      "endMs": 375297
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "I've got an older brother that I'll never see.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 375641,
      "endMs": 377986
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "He's a jazz musician or some such. Oh, well. Bye-bye.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 378159,
      "endMs": 381745
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "It must be awful to be all alone in the world.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 381917,
      "endMs": 384676
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Well, I always had my music.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 384883,
      "endMs": 386745
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "I learned at the feet of Blind Willy Witherspoon.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 386917,
      "endMs": 390538
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "I've been playing jazz for 30 years, and I just can't make a go of it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 391917,
      "endMs": 395676
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "I want you to have my saxophone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 395848,
      "endMs": 397814
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "This isn't a saxophone, it's an umbrella.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 398021,
      "endMs": 400814
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "So I've played a umbrella for 30 years?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 401055,
      "endMs": 403055
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Why didn't anybody tell me?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 403228,
      "endMs": 404641
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "We all thought it was funny. That's not funny.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 405366,
      "endMs": 408952
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "Then I got my big break. I was on Steve Allen's Tonight! Show.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 409159,
      "endMs": 413676
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Now, a brilliant jazz musician who's inspired me to do some improv poetry.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 415434,
      "endMs": 420538
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "Twinkle, twinkle, groovy cat How I wonder where you at I really love the way you cook Like me, when I wrote this book How to Make Love to Steve Allen.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 420745,
      "endMs": 428607
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "From the author of Happiness Is a Naked Steve Allen...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 428814,
      "endMs": 431366
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "...Journey to the Center of Steve Allen and The Joy of Cooking Steve Allen.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 431538,
      "endMs": 436366
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "I cut my first and only album, Sax on the Beach.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 436572,
      "endMs": 439917
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "But then I spent all my money on my $ 1500-a-day habit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 440124,
      "endMs": 445124
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "I'd like another Faberg� egg, please.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 446021,
      "endMs": 448676
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "Sir, don't you think you've had enough? I'll tell you when I've had enough!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 448848,
      "endMs": 452848
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "When was the last time you worked?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 454986,
      "endMs": 456917
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "In '86, when I did a guest shot on The Cosby Show.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 457124,
      "endMs": 460986
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "Hey, kids. Meet Grandpa Murphy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 461986,
      "endMs": 465503
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "But we have three grandpas already.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 465710,
      "endMs": 468021
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "This one is a great jazz musician.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 468228,
      "endMs": 470503
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "They all are.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 470710,
      "endMs": 472331
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "You see, the kids, they listen to the rap music...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 473193,
      "endMs": 476814
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "...which gives them the brain damage.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 476986,
      "endMs": 479159
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "With their hipping and the hopping and the bipping and the bopping.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 479366,
      "endMs": 483607
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "So they don't know what the jazz is all about.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 483779,
      "endMs": 487641
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "You see, jazz is like a Jell-O Pudding Pop.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 487917,
      "endMs": 490986
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "No. Actually, it's more like Kodak film.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 491159,
      "endMs": 494090
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "No. Actually, jazz is like the New Coke.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 494262,
      "endMs": 497607
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "It'll be around forever.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 497779,
      "endMs": 500366
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Wow, you've had some career.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 502883,
      "endMs": 504848
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "Although the moral seems to be that a life of jazz leaves you sad and lonely.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 505021,
      "endMs": 508848
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "Well, before you came to visit, I would have agreed with you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 509021,
      "endMs": 513400
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "This just in: Krusty the Clown staged a press conference today...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 515710,
      "endMs": 519228
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "...to defend himself against charges that his products are unsafe...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 519400,
      "endMs": 522710
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "...his theme park is a deathtrap...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 522883,
      "endMs": 524641
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "...and that he's marketing videos of Tonya Harding's wedding night.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 524814,
      "endMs": 529055
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "I contend the tourists were decapitated...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 529297,
      "endMs": 531297
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "...before they entered the Krustyland House of Knives. Next question.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 531469,
      "endMs": 535228
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "What about that little boy who got appendicitis from eating your cereal?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 535400,
      "endMs": 540676
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "To prove that this metal O is harmless, I will personally eat one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 540883,
      "endMs": 545641
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "See? There's nothing...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 546159,
      "endMs": 548538
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "Oh, boy! This thing is shredding my insides!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 550917,
      "endMs": 555262
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "Krusty, that wasn 't the metal one. That was a regular Krusty-O.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 555434,
      "endMs": 559297
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "It's poison.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 559469,
      "endMs": 561055
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "So you all set for your recital? I sure am. Look.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 562159,
      "endMs": 566124
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "I stopped brushing my teeth so I can play just like you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 566745,
      "endMs": 569779
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "Lisa, honey, music comes from what's in your heart, not what's on your teeth.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 570469,
      "endMs": 575021
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "Come on, let's jam.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 575193,
      "endMs": 576952
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "Hey, Moe, what will you give me for an A.A. Chip?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 632021,
      "endMs": 635124
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "Barney, this is a five-minute chip. It's worth a Pabst.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 635366,
      "endMs": 639434
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "Baby, you are gonna knock them dead.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 643159,
      "endMs": 646814
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "Here, take this for luck.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 648434,
      "endMs": 650641
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "Your sax! Thank you so much.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 651228,
      "endMs": 654710
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "Now, I have learned that most of the orchestra...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 660986,
      "endMs": 663262
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "...is having their appendixes removed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 663469,
      "endMs": 665297
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "So without further ado, I give you the remnants...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 665469,
      "endMs": 668021
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "...of the Springfield Elementary School orchestra.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 668193,
      "endMs": 671055
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "On saxophone, Lisa Simpson. On triangle, Martin Prince.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 671262,
      "endMs": 675193
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "And with a flute up his nose, Ralph Wiggum.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 675366,
      "endMs": 679469
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "That's some nice fluting.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 680262,
      "endMs": 681469
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "They'll play \"Stars and Stripes Forever.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 681676,
      "endMs": 683607
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "Hopefully not forever.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 683779,
      "endMs": 685883
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "This sucks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 691262,
      "endMs": 693124
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "Hey, Bleeding Gums, I was great! And I owe it all to...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 705090,
      "endMs": 709297
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "What happened to Mr. Murphy?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 709503,
      "endMs": 710986
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "I'm sorry. He passed away.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 711193,
      "endMs": 712952
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "Lisa, honey, are you gonna be okay?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 726297,
      "endMs": 728641
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "Bleeding Gums was my hero, and I never got to tell him how I felt.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 729159,
      "endMs": 732986
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "Oh, I'm sure he knew.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 733193,
      "endMs": 734434
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "And I'm sure that wherever he is now, he's happy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 734607,
      "endMs": 737469
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "But he was the only person who had the same love for music that I do.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 737676,
      "endMs": 742159
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "Thank you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 743745,
      "endMs": 745193
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "Oh, Dad, why did he have to die?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 745366,
      "endMs": 748090
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "Well, it's like the time that your cat, Snowball, got run over.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 748297,
      "endMs": 752538
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "Remember, honey? Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 752710,
      "endMs": 754228
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "What I'm saying is, all we have to do...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 754434,
      "endMs": 756952
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "...is go down to the pound and get a new jazzman.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 757124,
      "endMs": 760021
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "Oh, Dad!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 760193,
      "endMs": 762917
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "I blew it again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 766090,
      "endMs": 767676
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 767848,
      "endMs": 769228
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "Hey, Lis, you still upset about that jazz guy?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 772262,
      "endMs": 774400
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "If it helps, I believe that after you die...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 774917,
      "endMs": 777917
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "...you can come back as whatever you want.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 778090,
      "endMs": 780434
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "I'll be a butterfly. How come?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 780607,
      "endMs": 782538
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "Because nobody ever suspects the butterfly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 782745,
      "endMs": 788366
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "I didn't burn down the school.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 790055,
      "endMs": 791641
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "It was the butterfly, I tell you. The butterfly!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 791814,
      "endMs": 794848
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "He's crazy, boys. Get the Taser.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 795055,
      "endMs": 797159
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "Maybe I need to talk to somebody with a little more age and wisdom.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 803779,
      "endMs": 807572
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "Death stalks you at every turn.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 807814,
      "endMs": 810607
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "Grampa. Well, it does.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 810814,
      "endMs": 813400
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "There it is. Death!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 814400,
      "endMs": 816228
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "It's only Maggie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 816400,
      "endMs": 817710
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "Oh, yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 818538,
      "endMs": 819883
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "You know, at my age, the mind starts playing tricks. So...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 820055,
      "endMs": 824745
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "Death! That's only the cat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 824917,
      "endMs": 827262
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "Death! That's Maggie again, Grampa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 828262,
      "endMs": 831366
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "Where were we? Death!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 831986,
      "endMs": 834779
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "How come it won't stop hurting?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 837469,
      "endMs": 839986
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "Lisa, it's normal to be sad when a friend dies.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 840572,
      "endMs": 843228
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "And Bleeding Gums was a good friend to you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 843400,
      "endMs": 845434
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "But nobody is really gone as long as we remember them.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 845607,
      "endMs": 848986
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "If you really want to preserve his memory...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 849228,
      "endMs": 851469
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "...I recommend getting a tattoo. It preserves the things you love.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 851641,
      "endMs": 856434
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "\"Starland Vocal Band\"? They suck!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 857193,
      "endMs": 860090
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "Death!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 860503,
      "endMs": 862193
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "Isn't anybody gonna show up? Well, Lisa, we've waited an hour.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 869917,
      "endMs": 874159
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "Dearly beloved, we are gathered here today...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 874883,
      "endMs": 878400
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "...to bid farewell to Blood and Guts Murphy...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 878607,
      "endMs": 881366
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "No! It was Bleeding Gums Murphy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 881538,
      "endMs": 884503
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "Anyway, Bloody Gums Murphy was quite the sousaphone player...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 884676,
      "endMs": 888366
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "Saxophone! He was a jazz musician.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 888538,
      "endMs": 891814
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "You didn't know him. Nobody knew him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 892021,
      "endMs": 894159
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "But he was a great man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 894366,
      "endMs": 895779
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "And I won't rest until all of Springfield...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 895952,
      "endMs": 898676
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "...knows the name Bleeding Gums Murphy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 898848,
      "endMs": 901538
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "And I won't rest until I've gotten a hot dog.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 901710,
      "endMs": 904297
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "Homer, this is a cemetery.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 904469,
      "endMs": 905952
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "Hot dogs! Get your hot dogs here!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 906124,
      "endMs": 909986
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "What do you do, follow my husband around?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 910159,
      "endMs": 912503
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "Lady, he's putting my kids through college.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 912676,
      "endMs": 916055
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "Good news, Bart. The Krusty-O Cereal Corp...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 917807,
      "endMs": 920359
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "...has settled your case for $ 100,000, less, of course, my legal fees.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 920600,
      "endMs": 925083
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "What kind of legal fees?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 925290,
      "endMs": 926772
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "Well, for a case this complex...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 926979,
      "endMs": 928600
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "...I had to assemble a crack team of lawyers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 928772,
      "endMs": 931359
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "Ronald Chaporo, trial attorney.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 931531,
      "endMs": 933566
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "Albert Dershman, who can hold three billiard balls in his mouth.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 933738,
      "endMs": 937255
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "How much of the 100 thou do I get?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 937497,
      "endMs": 939876
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "Five hundred dollars?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 941359,
      "endMs": 943186
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "Yes, well... Cool.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 943393,
      "endMs": 945255
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "Glad you're happy. Let's roll.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 945462,
      "endMs": 948497
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "I can't believe it. Five hundred bucks!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 950721,
      "endMs": 953307
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "Just think what I can do with that money.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 953479,
      "endMs": 956893
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "Five hundred dollars on red.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 958238,
      "endMs": 960962
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "The winner is black.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 962203,
      "endMs": 963583
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "Cool.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 965297,
      "endMs": 966370
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "I wanna honor Bleeding Gums' memory, but I don't know where to start.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 966572,
      "endMs": 970129
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "Maybe you could get the local jazz station to do a tribute to him, huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 970330,
      "endMs": 974122
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "Jazz. They just make it up as they go along. I could do that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 974290,
      "endMs": 978384
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "That's \"Mary Had a Little Lamb.\" Okay, then this:",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 981035,
      "endMs": 983485
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "That's the same thing. You just replaced \"dees\" with \"do's.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 986505,
      "endMs": 989391
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "I have a request. I'd like you to do a tribute to Bleeding Gums Murphy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 990766,
      "endMs": 994022
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "I'd love to, little sister, but we don't have his album.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 994189,
      "endMs": 996874
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "What if I could find it? I'd spin it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 997075,
      "endMs": 999055
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "But ain't no one gonna hear it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 999256,
      "endMs": 1000800
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "Our broadcast range is only 23 feet...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1000968,
      "endMs": 1002780
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "...which makes us the most powerful jazz station in the entire U.S. Of A.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1002948,
      "endMs": 1006471
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "Gee, your station has a lot of problems.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1006706,
      "endMs": 1008485
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "Tell me about it. Just look at our morning guy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1008686,
      "endMs": 1011068
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "Hello. This is \"Moleman in the Morning.\" Good Moleman to you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1011270,
      "endMs": 1016270
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "Today, part four of our series of the agonizing pain...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1016471,
      "endMs": 1019558
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "...in which I live every day.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1019726,
      "endMs": 1022679
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "Two hundred and fifty dollars?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1024995,
      "endMs": 1027344
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "But I need that album to honor the memory of Bleeding Gums Murphy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1027545,
      "endMs": 1030766
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "He's dead? Well, why didn't you say so?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1030968,
      "endMs": 1033384
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "Where am I gonna get $500?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1039122,
      "endMs": 1041337
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "Now drive, Smithers. Drive.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1050699,
      "endMs": 1052948
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "Excuse me, my good man, I have $500 to blow.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1059290,
      "endMs": 1061572
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "What have you got? Behold the ultimate Pog.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1061706,
      "endMs": 1065230
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "I'll take it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1067008,
      "endMs": 1068820
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "Lisa, look what I've got. Ta-da!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1080599,
      "endMs": 1084525
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "Bart, I can't believe it. But why?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1085062,
      "endMs": 1088317
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "When I said my stomach hurt, you were the only one who believed me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1088485,
      "endMs": 1091572
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "Oh, thank you. But $500...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1091740,
      "endMs": 1094928
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "You'll never see that much money again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1095095,
      "endMs": 1097377
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "Oh, yeah? Take a look at this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1097579,
      "endMs": 1099592
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "I got the album.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1103283,
      "endMs": 1105632
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "Here. You can listen to it on this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1106673,
      "endMs": 1109223
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "I did the best I could, Bleeding Gums.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1112411,
      "endMs": 1115330
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "Attention, all units. Attention, all units.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1138243,
      "endMs": 1141095
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "Poison-gas cloud heading for...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1141263,
      "endMs": 1143881
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "That's nice. Hey, it's getting cloudy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1146397,
      "endMs": 1149887
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "text": "Oh, boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1151263,
      "endMs": 1152605
    },
    {
      "index": 272,
      "text": "That was for you, Bleeding Gums.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1163411,
      "endMs": 1166062
    },
    {
      "index": 273,
      "text": "You've made an old jazzman happy, Lisa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1167673,
      "endMs": 1170827
    },
    {
      "index": 274,
      "text": "You must avenge my death, Kimba. I mean, Simba.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1170995,
      "endMs": 1175290
    },
    {
      "index": 275,
      "text": "Luke, I am your father.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1175458,
      "endMs": 1177572
    },
    {
      "index": 276,
      "text": "This is CNN.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1177706,
      "endMs": 1179485
    },
    {
      "index": 277,
      "text": "Will you guys pipe down? I'm saying goodbye to Lisa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1179619,
      "endMs": 1183277
    },
    {
      "index": 278,
      "text": "We're sorry.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1183444,
      "endMs": 1185391
    },
    {
      "index": 279,
      "text": "I don't want you to go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1185592,
      "endMs": 1187404
    },
    {
      "index": 280,
      "text": "Sorry, but I have to. Goodbye.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1187605,
      "endMs": 1190223
    },
    {
      "index": 281,
      "text": "Goodbye.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1191431,
      "endMs": 1193277
    },
    {
      "index": 282,
      "text": "Oh, what the heck. Once more, from the top.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1197370,
      "endMs": 1200055
    },
    {
      "index": 283,
      "text": "One more time!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1267035,
      "endMs": 1268545
    },
    {
      "index": 284,
      "text": "Oh, come on, Lisa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1268713,
      "endMs": 1270491
    },
    {
      "index": 285,
      "text": "I got a date with Billie Holiday. www.tvsubtitles.net",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1270659,
      "endMs": 2000
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "show": "The Simpsons",
